					"fontname": "Arial",
					"fontsize": 9.0,
					"text": "Litter Starter Pack users should be aware that many of the clippings make use of Pro objects. Those Litter Power users running Mac OS can easily identify Starter Pack and Pro clippings in the Finder: like the Finder icons of other Litter Power objects, clippings using Litter Power Pro objects are tinted orange while clippings that only use Starter Pack objects are tinted green."
